      "message": "My preference from an API standpoint would be to keep this an internal detail of DawnCommandBuffer. It should be possible to forward declare an inner class inside `DawnCommandBuffer` so that it can be used in return types for `beginRenderPass` but have everything entirely defined in the CPP file.",
