      "writtenOn": "2025-03-17T19:44:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t like having these functions exposed as two separate operations. Can we move the pipeline creation logic back into `DawnResourceProvider` but update its signature so that it takes what it needs, e.g. a dst texture format + sample count (reduced renderpass key) and a src sample count.",
