      "writtenOn": "2025-03-17T20:47:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My original intention to move to separate class is that the drawing code and the shader code could be self contained in a single file. Originally I wanted to support different offsets between MSAA textures and resolve textures. So that would require some bit hacks to send the offsets to shaders via `base instance` without extra buffers since Dawn doesn\u0027t support push constants yet.\n\nBut now I think that\u0027s not needed yet. I think it makese sense to keep the pipeline creation in the resource provider.",
