      "message": "Since the depth attachment normally ought to be matching the color attachment, we could just update the call to `getDepthAttachmentDimensions` to take in the TextureInfo and dimensions from `colorAttachment`. This will then match the dimensions whether or not it called `GetApproxSize`.\n\nOne complexity is I\u0027m not sure how this new logic will behave when we are rendering into a U or V plane that\u0027s at half the size of Y, but we are also resolving to a MSAA color attachment.",
