      "writtenOn": "2025-03-17T20:47:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right, looks like the logic here doesn\u0027t handle the U/V plane\u0027s rendering case properly.\n- If the U/V texture is rendered to directly without AA:  `getDepthAttachmentDimensions` should return Y plane size. So nothing changed. We don\u0027t need emulation here.\n- If the U/V texture is rendered with AA: We use separate render passes. The main render pass doesn\u0027t use the U/V texture as a resolve texture. So no U/V restrictions are applied. I think `getDepthAttachmentDimensions` should be updated to be aware of this and just return the `GetApproxSize`.\n\nPerhaps we need to pass the renderPass\u0027s sampleCount to `getDepthAttachmentDimensions`. Target\u0027s `TextureInfo` is single sampled anw.",
      "parentUuid": "7596b4a9_85d86edf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 181,
